{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ahoy, Rhythm Buccaneer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on a <strong>beat-blasting pirate quest</strong> where every boss fight is a <strong>full-blown musical number</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attack hits <i>on the rhythm</i> \u2014 <strong>learn the beat</strong>, <i>dodge the pattern</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master simple controls:</strong> move left and right, or up and down. <i>That\u2019s it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <i>dancing crabs</i> to <i>penguin DJs</i> \u2014 each choreographed to an <strong>original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your course through <strong>pirate-infested worlds</strong> to <strong>rescue your kidnapped cat</strong>, one <i>groovy showdown</i> at a time.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Thief Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721290/71577167e1f62a865a48788080e31518f950b78d.jpg"},{"name":"Pirate Rock Stadium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721290/b3c1f66b9fff6440d1b4528a88a3d3f36b29110a.jpg"},{"name":"Monkey Bar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721290/4d5a2d3402dfbc51bab6ba22878bdc2f1fff3a12.jpg"},{"name":"Coco & Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721290/e36ae50af768ec35d21f33b696b7889638bf642f.jpg"},{"name":"Pelican Party","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721290/4540a1df277fccd0e137feae4ad85b898e8196ed.jpg"},{"name":"Penguin Icefest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721290/a98ec5947ff68b60f49063659c012468bd2fd903.jpg"},{"name":"Grave Groove","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3721290/4e36b0c634e12445def72d3653d81e3c0d0279a0.jpg"},{"name":"Crab's Lair","path":"htt